<section class="mx-auto max-w-xl mt-10">
  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">2024: Takahiro Anno (Team Mirai)</h3>
  <p class="mt-4">
    Takahiro Anno, leader of Team Mirai, used Polimoney to publish the income and expenditure of the "2024 Digital Democracy Study Group" (デジタル民主主義を考える会).
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4">
    <a
      href="https://polimoney.dd2030.org/takahiro-anno/2024"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="btn btn-outline h-9"
      hreflang="ja"
    >
      See this case (Japanese) →
    </a>
  </div>
  <h3 class="text-2xl mt-8">2024: Ryosuke Idei (Liberal Democratic Party)</h3>
  <p class="mt-4">
    Ryosuke Idei of the Liberal Democratic Party used Polimoney to publish the income and expenditure of the LDP Tokyo Nakano Ward 20th Branch for 2024.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4">
    <a
      href="https://polimoney.dd2030.org/ryosuke-idei/2024"
      target="_blank"
